---
import { CircleArrowRight } from "@lucide/astro";
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-14 max-w-6xl my-10 md:my-14 lg:my-20 xl:my-24">
        <div class="col-center gap-2">
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center pt-4 fade-in-up">
                Strategic Focus Markets & Use Cases
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500 max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto pt-4 fade-in-up">
                Our alliance primarily targets industrial corridors and logistics hubs in India, including Chennai / Tamil Nadu, Bengaluru, Madurai, Hosur, and expanding to other high-demand regions. Key use cases include:
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="w-full flex items-stretch gap-10 pt-6 md:pt-8 lg:pt-12">
            <div class="w-[50%] rounded-md fade-in-up">
                <Image src="/images/upload/warehouse-strategic-alliance.webp" alt="warehouse-strategic-alliance" width={625} height={420} class="w-full rounded-md" />
            </div>
            <div class="w-[50%] bg-white text-gray-700 rounded-md px-9 py-5 flex flex-col items-start justify-center gap-4 fade-in-up">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                    <CircleArrowRight size={22} />
                    <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto">
                        E-commerce growth & omni-channel demand
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-gray-600">
                    <CircleArrowRight size={22} />
                    <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto">
                        Sustainability & ESG compliance
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                    <CircleArrowRight size={22} />
                    <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto">
                        Automation & smart warehousing
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-gray-600">
                    <CircleArrowRight size={22}/>
                    <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto">
                        Land scarcity & regulatory delays
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                    <CircleArrowRight size={22} />
                    <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto">
                        Rising construction costs & supply chain volatility
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</>